{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01523","headline":"琴曲歌辞 拘幽操 · 韩愈","name":"琴曲歌辞 拘幽操","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"目揜揜兮其凝其盲，耳肃肃兮听不闻声。\n朝不日出兮夜不见月与星，有知无知兮爲死爲生。\n呜呼！臣罪当诛兮天王圣明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01523.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01523","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}